% holding-blocked: This original is licence-safe and fully notated, but it has not been played by students. A Grade 6 music teacher must trial the two crossing layers (3+3 against 2+2+2) at the proposed tempo; a Zimbabwean music educator or culture bearer must review the chimurenga history and the mbira-guitar comparison; a second score reader must check the notes; and someone must replace the discovery search with an authorized link to Thomas Mapfumo's "Shumba" (a label, archive or official artist page) and confirm its first release.
